          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-2151",
          "body_paragraph": 1,
          "quote": "I have just ordered a pair of Smiters from a Mr. Roe of Salisbury",
          "char_start": 210,
          "char_end": 275,
          "source_sha256": "7ecc812d4723773e3d8f72532688a7e859113e2966b993280ecd1edb45b9f22c",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[2]"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-2151",
          "body_paragraph": 3,
          "quote": "I have lately seen a short abstract in Athenæum of a communication by you on the variation of Plants by culture",
          "char_start": 0,
          "char_end": 111,
          "source_sha256": "7ecc812d4723773e3d8f72532688a7e859113e2966b993280ecd1edb45b9f22c",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[4]"
        }
      ],
      "verified_authorial_enclosure": {
        "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-2151",
        "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[2]/div/p",
        "source_sha256": "7ecc812d4723773e3d8f72532688a7e859113e2966b993280ecd1edb45b9f22c",
        "full_text": "(1)Whence were the Smiters procured: if from abroad what name did they bear? (2)What are the peculiarities in their habits? (3)Will they display their peculiarities in a cage, some 5 or 6 yards long by 4 or 5 broad & ten ft high? Or must they be quite free.— (4).Are the peculiarities the same in Cock & Hen? are they equally displayed in all; or are some Birds much better than others? I refer of course, only to pure bred Birds.— (5)Do they breed true in form & colour?",
        "question_count": 5,
        "voice": "Darwin authorial enclosure, not editorial annotation"
      },
